flowchart TD
  A[Integrity incident] --> B[Localize affected scope]
  B --> C[Identify last trusted basis]
  C --> D[Reconstruct candidate]
  D --> E[Compare current and candidate]
  E --> F[Generate selective recovery proposal]
  F --> G{Required approval present?}
  G -->|No| H[Preserve proposal and stop]
  G -->|Yes| I[Execute protected recovery transaction]
  I --> J[Create new recovery version]
  J --> K[Verify and checkpoint]
